From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:08:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "pixel: Drop powerstats HAL"

Not for the HIDL power.stats service -- bonito stopped shipping that --
but for the library underneath it. powerstats/aidl defines
pixelpowerstats_provider_aidl_interface, and vendor/google/bonito's
libnos_citadeld_proxy links the -cpp variant of it:

  error: vendor/google/bonito/Android.bp:14763:1: "libnos_citadeld_proxy"
      depends on undefined module "pixelpowerstats_provider_aidl_interface-cpp".

libnos_citadeld_proxy is the citadeld proxy for the Titan M, so dropping
this takes the security chip's daemon with it. The blob decides, and the
blob still wants the interface.

